vel with sub-fund breakdowns.\n\n**AGMs**\n- **ICAV:** No annual general meeting is mandatory. Shareholders can dispense with one or pass resolutions in writing.\n- **Plc:** An AGM must be held annually, within six months of year-end, under the Companies Act 2014.\n\n**US tax classification**\n- **ICAV:** Not a per se corporation. It is an eligible entity that can elect its classification (for example, via Form 8832 check-the-box) or default to partnership or disregarded treatment.\n- **Plc:** Listed as a per se corporation under Treas. Reg. §301.7701-2(b)(8), so no election is available.\n\nConfirm specifics with fund counsel and tax advisers.","ttft_ms":8508,"type":"result","duration_ms":9795,"uuid":"adbcedb5-5a96-4f44-a0d8-fefb76354ef5","ttft_stream_ms":850,"time_to_request_ms":93,"first_content_frame_ms":850,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
